NODE_ENV=production
HOST=0.0.0.0
PORT=3000

Set this if the frontend is hosted on a different domain.

PUBLIC_BASE_URL=

Comma-separated list of allowed frontend origins.

CORS_ORIGINS=

Public contact address for legal or takedown requests.

CONTACT_EMAIL=

Job and resource limits.

MAX_CONCURRENT_JOBS=2
MAX_QUEUED_JOBS=10
JOB_TIMEOUT_MS=600000
JOB_RETENTION_MS=1800000
CLEANUP_INTERVAL_MS=60000
MAX_VIDEO_DURATION_SECONDS=3600
MAX_OUTPUT_BYTES=1073741824

Executable names or paths.

YTDLP_PATH=yt-dlp
FFMPEG_PATH=ffmpeg

Optional temporary directory.

TEMP_DIR=
